WEBVTT

00:01:39.560 --> 00:01:42.530
<i>As a rule, I get rid of 
things I don't need anymore.</i>

00:01:42.530 --> 00:01:45.480
<i>That's why I've gotten into the habit 
of sorting through my belongings.</i>

00:01:47.400 --> 00:01:49.630
<i>There's a limit to how much I can carry,</i>

00:01:50.020 --> 00:01:52.160
<i>so I always try to pack light.</i>

00:01:52.780 --> 00:01:53.570
<i>But...</i>

00:01:54.920 --> 00:01:56.510
This raincoat...

00:01:56.950 --> 00:01:59.250
Didn't I get it while shopping with Yuuka?

00:02:01.690 --> 00:02:03.750
<i>Say, Yuuka...</i>

00:02:05.270 --> 00:02:06.710
<i>what are you...</i>

00:02:07.600 --> 00:02:08.940
<i>doing right now?</i>

00:02:09.810 --> 00:02:14.780
Raincoat Memories

00:02:11.810 --> 00:02:14.780
~Say, Yuuka, what are you doing right now?

00:02:16.080 --> 00:02:17.990
She's got brains and a great figure,

00:02:17.990 --> 00:02:19.670
but she's weird.

00:02:19.670 --> 00:02:21.240
Yeah, she climbs mountains.

00:02:21.610 --> 00:02:23.730
Isn't she scared all by herself...?

00:02:24.400 --> 00:02:28.000
<i>That was the impression I 
gave back in middle school.</i>

00:02:30.460 --> 00:02:31.440
Yuuka?

00:02:31.890 --> 00:02:34.550
What happened? Did you get hurt 
while mountain climbing again?

00:02:34.670 --> 00:02:35.880
Yeah, I did.

00:02:35.880 --> 00:02:38.700
But it's nothing, I just 
skinned my knees a little.

00:02:38.700 --> 00:02:42.350
Isn't it dangerous for a girl to 
go mountain climbing by herself?!

00:02:42.350 --> 00:02:44.300
Yes, but I enjoy it.

00:02:44.630 --> 00:02:47.210
Thanks for worrying about me, Yuuka.

00:02:55.290 --> 00:02:57.860
<i>I'd always gone climbing alone.</i>

00:02:58.920 --> 00:03:00.900
<i>I could do anything I wanted.</i>

00:03:02.770 --> 00:03:04.140
<i>It made me happy.</i>

00:03:06.230 --> 00:03:08.540
Say, are you climbing another high mountain?

00:03:08.940 --> 00:03:10.470
Do you have the equipment for it?

00:03:10.470 --> 00:03:11.810
Will you be all right?

00:03:11.810 --> 00:03:13.400
Like I said, I'll be fine!

00:03:13.400 --> 00:03:15.090
This time, I'll get you a souvenir!

00:03:15.290 --> 00:03:17.680
That's not the issue!

00:03:17.680 --> 00:03:18.840
Now, now...

00:03:18.980 --> 00:03:21.130
It's nothing for you to be concerned about.

00:03:28.850 --> 00:03:31.500
Is this really all that dangerous...?

00:03:31.500 --> 00:03:34.520
It doesn't seem like anything for 
Yuuka to be concerned about.

00:03:35.390 --> 00:03:36.320
<i>But...</i>

00:03:36.320 --> 00:03:39.400
<i>I get the feeling it's something else...</i>

00:03:39.770 --> 00:03:41.620
<i>What could it be?</i>

00:03:47.360 --> 00:03:50.290
Geez! I don't know anymore!

00:03:50.290 --> 00:03:52.710
Why am I feeling so gloomy?

00:03:56.750 --> 00:03:59.600
Kaede?! You got badly hurt again?

00:04:00.230 --> 00:04:01.630
It's fine, just a little sprain.

00:04:01.630 --> 00:04:03.050
No it's not!

00:04:03.210 --> 00:04:04.710
How can you say it's fine?

00:04:04.710 --> 00:04:06.890
You're not fine at all!

00:04:26.100 --> 00:04:29.200
Maybe she hates me now...

00:04:29.410 --> 00:04:31.550
<i>She didn't have to yell at me like that.</i>

00:04:31.970 --> 00:04:35.410
<i>It's not like my life is 
any of her concern, right?</i>

00:04:38.210 --> 00:04:40.120
<i>I don't mean to trouble her...</i>

00:04:40.440 --> 00:04:41.730
<i>but have I?</i>

00:04:42.350 --> 00:04:45.120
<i>I just force a smile and tell her, "Thank you."</i>

00:04:45.120 --> 00:04:49.300
<i>But have I ever taken anything 
Yuuka said to heart?</i>

00:04:49.620 --> 00:04:53.590
<i>I've always raced ahead, 
making all my own decisions</i>

00:04:53.960 --> 00:04:56.310
<i>and moving forward on them.</i>

00:04:56.820 --> 00:05:00.440
<i>I'd convinced myself that Yuuka's 
worries weren't my problem.</i>

00:05:00.850 --> 00:05:01.480
<i>But...</i>

00:05:01.990 --> 00:05:04.010
<i>Even though she didn't need to be,</i>

00:05:04.010 --> 00:05:06.090
<i>Yuuka was sincerely worried about me.</i>

00:05:07.660 --> 00:05:10.530
<i>Yet I wasn't paying enough attention to notice.</i>

00:05:15.940 --> 00:05:18.170
I'm awful...

00:05:20.360 --> 00:05:24.090
<i>When you walk with someone else, 
you match your pace with theirs.</i>

00:05:24.370 --> 00:05:26.760
<i>That's what you do when 
spending time with others.</i>

00:05:28.470 --> 00:05:31.310
<i>If you get too far ahead of them,</i>

00:05:31.310 --> 00:05:32.440
<i>you stand still for a bit,</i>

00:05:33.490 --> 00:05:35.740
<i>so that your partner can catch up with you.</i>

00:05:40.200 --> 00:05:41.360
See you later!

00:05:45.270 --> 00:05:46.700
G-Good morning.

00:05:50.910 --> 00:05:52.520
Um, uh...

00:05:52.520 --> 00:05:53.800
Uh, say...

00:05:55.230 --> 00:05:58.580
Sorry about earlier. I know 
you were worried about me,

00:05:58.920 --> 00:06:01.170
so I'll try to take better care of myself.

00:06:03.930 --> 00:06:05.920
It's too late for apologies.

00:06:08.880 --> 00:06:10.340
Just kidding!

00:06:11.590 --> 00:06:13.570
I'm sorry too, for yelling!

00:06:13.570 --> 00:06:14.560
I just...

00:06:15.370 --> 00:06:16.260
Yeah...

00:06:16.260 --> 00:06:17.680
I really am sorry.

00:06:18.240 --> 00:06:19.220
<i>Yuuka...</i>

00:06:19.220 --> 00:06:20.310
<i>Thank you...</i>

00:06:20.690 --> 00:06:21.680
Kaede?

00:06:21.680 --> 00:06:23.520
Oh, it's nothing.

00:06:25.210 --> 00:06:26.780
<i>I finally understood...</i>

00:06:27.200 --> 00:06:28.690
<i>what I'd been missing.</i>

00:06:29.110 --> 00:06:31.670
<i>The feeling that had been 
on my mind all that time...</i>

00:06:32.220 --> 00:06:33.780
<i>was loneliness.</i>

00:06:34.750 --> 00:06:38.040
<i>I'd been afraid that everyone 
would just ignore me,</i>

00:06:38.550 --> 00:06:40.540
<i>and then I'd end up all alone.</i>

00:06:42.790 --> 00:06:43.920
<i>Say, Yuuka...</i>

00:06:44.380 --> 00:06:46.460
<i>I'd never realized before,</i>

00:06:47.180 --> 00:06:51.300
<i>how having someone that will worry 
about you and get angry at you</i>

00:06:51.680 --> 00:06:54.590
<i>can be a very happy thing.</i>

00:06:55.460 --> 00:06:56.520
What's wrong?

00:06:56.730 --> 00:06:58.520
Oh, nothing.

00:07:00.770 --> 00:07:05.730
Hanno Station - North Entrance

00:07:00.920 --> 00:07:03.670
Next time, I'm buying a new raincoat.

00:07:03.670 --> 00:07:05.730
The one I use now is worn out already.

00:07:07.120 --> 00:07:09.360
Can I join you for shopping?

00:07:11.240 --> 00:07:13.910
Well, I've gotten a little curious.

00:07:14.120 --> 00:07:16.330
And while we're there...

00:07:16.580 --> 00:07:20.660
I'll try to get you to dress 
a bit more like a girl.

00:07:24.120 --> 00:07:26.690
Yeah! It looks great on you!

00:07:26.690 --> 00:07:28.880
I-Isn't it a bit <i>too</i> girly?

00:07:28.880 --> 00:07:31.040
No, it's fine!

00:07:31.040 --> 00:07:33.850
Kaede, you're tall and have a great figure.

00:07:33.850 --> 00:07:35.380
D-Do you think so...?

00:07:35.380 --> 00:07:37.220
I <i>know</i> so! What a waste!

00:07:37.650 --> 00:07:39.650
Okay, next we'll get your raincoat!

00:07:44.860 --> 00:07:46.590
There sure are a lot of them!

00:07:46.920 --> 00:07:50.050
Raincoats are very important 
for mountain climbing.

00:07:50.050 --> 00:07:50.940
Really?

00:07:51.170 --> 00:07:54.290
Since raincoats block the 
wind as well as the rain,

00:07:54.290 --> 00:07:57.150
many wear them for protection against the cold.

00:07:57.150 --> 00:07:59.610
Plus, on top of the mountain...

00:07:59.610 --> 00:08:02.030
rain comes at you sideways and from below,

00:08:02.030 --> 00:08:03.940
so umbrellas don't work.

00:08:07.860 --> 00:08:10.120
Wow, they're pretty expensive!

00:08:10.120 --> 00:08:13.380
It's to be expected, considering all the 
added features for mountain climbing.

00:08:13.670 --> 00:08:15.100
Try touching it.

00:08:15.600 --> 00:08:16.830
It's unusually stiff.

00:08:16.830 --> 00:08:18.170
It's light, too!

00:08:18.170 --> 00:08:18.930
Right!

00:08:18.930 --> 00:08:21.410
It's light and sturdy to keep 
rain from getting through,

00:08:21.410 --> 00:08:23.760
but still allows sweat to breathe out.

00:08:23.760 --> 00:08:27.800
Since they use such amazing materials, 
raincoats can get pretty expensive.

00:08:27.800 --> 00:08:29.400
That makes sense!

00:08:29.600 --> 00:08:33.650
There are also water-resistant 
gloves and rain skirts.

00:08:34.010 --> 00:08:38.370
These rain pants are the kind 
you can pull on over your shoes.

00:08:38.370 --> 00:08:39.660
They're very handy!

00:08:39.810 --> 00:08:44.400
I was once told I was risking my life being 
on top of a mountain during a rainstorm.

00:08:45.070 --> 00:08:45.920
What is it?

00:08:47.040 --> 00:08:48.610
It's nothing!

00:08:48.610 --> 00:08:49.830
But...

00:08:49.830 --> 00:08:53.800
It was just occurring to me that you actually 
do consider how to take care of yourself.

00:08:53.800 --> 00:08:54.940
Of course!

00:08:54.940 --> 00:08:57.190
After all, I don't want to die!

00:08:58.790 --> 00:09:01.050
So, which one are you getting?

00:09:03.560 --> 00:09:05.770
Isn't this cute?!

00:09:05.970 --> 00:09:07.850
The color really suits you!

00:09:07.850 --> 00:09:09.090
Really?

00:09:09.090 --> 00:09:10.400
Okay, I'll buy it.

00:09:11.020 --> 00:09:13.490
Thanks for helping me decide, Yuuka!

00:09:13.490 --> 00:09:13.990
Wait!

00:09:13.990 --> 00:09:16.230
On second thought, 
that other color looks more...

00:09:16.230 --> 00:09:17.240
Which one?!

00:09:17.240 --> 00:09:18.460
Just kidding!

00:09:21.420 --> 00:09:23.240
Thanks for joining me.

00:09:23.480 --> 00:09:24.760
What're you talking about?

00:09:24.760 --> 00:09:28.390
Like I said, I'm curious about what you do.

00:09:28.880 --> 00:09:29.540
Oh, right.

00:09:29.970 --> 00:09:31.140
You did say that.

00:09:31.750 --> 00:09:33.300
But, Kaede...

00:09:33.470 --> 00:09:37.050
You can get absentminded sometimes, 
so I can't help worrying about you.

00:09:37.350 --> 00:09:38.720
I'll be fine!

00:09:38.720 --> 00:09:40.800
If I get into danger, I'll just call you!

00:09:40.800 --> 00:09:42.360
Then you can come save me!

00:09:42.360 --> 00:09:46.100
Once again, that's not the point!

00:09:46.100 --> 00:09:47.470
Now, now...

00:09:47.470 --> 00:09:49.240
You're not cute when you're angry.

00:09:49.240 --> 00:09:50.360
Kaede!

00:09:51.110 --> 00:09:52.630
<i>Thank you so much...</i>

00:09:53.110 --> 00:09:54.090
<i>Yuuka...</i>

00:10:00.430 --> 00:10:01.400
<i>Yuuka...</i>

00:10:04.620 --> 00:10:05.120
Now...

00:10:06.180 --> 00:10:09.360
...this doesn't fit me anymore, 
so I've stopped wearing it.

00:10:10.750 --> 00:10:12.170
But, I just can't get rid of it.

00:10:14.930 --> 00:10:16.220
Say, Yuuka...

00:10:17.230 --> 00:10:18.740
what are you doing right now?

00:10:19.750 --> 00:10:21.030
I miss you!

00:10:27.740 --> 00:10:30.140
Hi, Yuuka? What are you doing right now?

00:10:30.520 --> 00:10:31.940
Nothing?

00:10:32.210 --> 00:10:35.160
In that case, come join me for some shopping!

00:10:35.160 --> 00:10:37.360
What, <i>now</i>?

00:10:37.360 --> 00:10:38.520
Why not?

00:10:38.520 --> 00:10:40.250
Just at Tokorozawa!

00:10:40.250 --> 00:10:42.210
There's some climbing gear I want to check out!

00:10:42.210 --> 00:10:44.630
All right, fine.

00:10:44.630 --> 00:10:46.450
I'll treat you to cake!

00:10:46.740 --> 00:10:49.460
Okay, see you in 30 minutes 
in front of the station!

00:10:51.600 --> 00:10:52.490
A text?

00:10:52.970 --> 00:10:54.460
It's from Aoi.

00:10:54.460 --> 00:10:59.970
Text Received
Subject: Need Advice
From: Aoi

00:10:55.030 --> 00:10:59.270
"I'd like to climb Mt. Tanigawa. 
Could you give me some advice?"

00:11:00.210 --> 00:11:02.610
"Sure, I'd be happy to!"

00:11:02.960 --> 00:11:03.970
Sent!

00:11:05.020 --> 00:11:07.120
Mt. Tanigawa, huh...

00:11:08.220 --> 00:11:11.240
<i>Just like how Yuuka worried about me,</i>

00:11:11.590 --> 00:11:15.370
<i>maybe I'll end up worrying about 
Aoi-chan and her friends too...</i>

00:11:17.350 --> 00:11:19.490
Well, later!

00:11:20.130 --> 00:11:21.630
I'll be back!

00:11:24.070 --> 00:11:26.710
<i>I'd always been walking by myself,</i>

00:11:26.710 --> 00:11:29.160
<i>but now I'm not alone anymore.</i>

00:11:29.160 --> 00:11:37.670
Hanno Station - North Entrance

00:11:29.600 --> 00:11:31.740
<i>I have Yuuka, and Aoi-chan and her friends, too.</i>

00:11:32.190 --> 00:11:34.250
Thanks for waiting, Yuuka!

00:11:34.250 --> 00:11:36.580
What took you so long, Kaede?!

00:11:36.580 --> 00:11:37.670
Sorry about that!

00:11:37.670 --> 00:11:46.850
Hanno Station - North Entrance

00:11:37.890 --> 00:11:39.890
Dressed like that again?!

00:11:39.890 --> 00:11:43.400
It's such a waste that you 
don't dress more like a girl!

00:11:43.400 --> 00:11:46.430
Haven't I told you that, like, a million times?!

00:11:47.240 --> 00:11:48.320
Oh, a UFO!

00:11:48.320 --> 00:11:49.930
Hey! You can't fool me!

00:11:49.930 --> 00:11:54.230
Hanno Station - North Entrance

00:11:50.150 --> 00:11:53.190
Now, now. You're not cute when you're angry!

00:11:53.190 --> 00:11:54.230
Wait up!

00:11:54.230 --> 00:11:55.860
Kaede!

00:11:56.550 --> 00:11:57.630
I'm <i>not</i> waiting!

00:11:57.630 --> 00:11:59.980
To Be Continued!
